   "childModal",
   "Move container data",
   "<template class=\"ui-dialog-head\"><span class=\"ui-head-name\">demo</span><span class=\"ui-head-where\">App · lab</span></template><p class=\"ui-lead\">The app stops while its storage changes. The progress is shown in <b>Recent jobs</b>.</p><div class=\"ui-callout warn\" role=\"alert\">\n      <span class=\"ui-callout-icon\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-alert\"/></svg></span>\n      <div><details class=\"ui-notice\" data-disclosure=\"notice:Check the backup first\"><summary><span class=\"ui-notice-line\"><b class=\"ui-notice-head\">Check the backup first</b><span class=\"ui-notice-first\">Files that already exist at the destination may be overwritten.</span></span><span class=\"ui-notice-chev\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span></summary><div class=\"ui-callout-body\"><p class=\"ui-issue\"><span class=\"ui-issue-short\">Files that already exist at the destination may be overwritten.</span><span class=\"ui-issue-more\"> Volumes are kept, but this is not a backup.</span></p></div></details></div>\n    </div><section class=\"ui-section\">\n    <header><h4>Storage changes</h4></header>\n    <div class=\"ui-table-wrap\"><table class=\"ui-table stack\"><thead><tr><th class=\"\">Container path</th><th class=\"\">From</th><th class=\"\">To</th></tr></thead>\n      <tbody><tr><td class=\"\" data-label=\"Container path\"><b>one</b><br>/data</td><td class=\"\" data-label=\"From\">old</td><td class=\"\" data-label=\"To\">new</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><p class=\"ui-lead\">Placement is checked again before copying and restarting. A step that fails, or whose result is unknown, stops so it can be checked. Nothing is retried or undone automatically.</p><details class=\"ui-more\" data-disclosure=\"Copy safety checks\">\n    <summary>Copy safety checks</summary><div class=\"ui-more-body\">The copy helper checks the destination paths and estimates the free space before copying. Estimates that are not available are listed in its log, and an estimate does not guarantee that the data fits. A failed copy keeps both volumes, and the app stays stopped. Check Recent jobs before trying again.</div></details><details class=\"ui-more\" data-disclosure=\"Capacity and placement details\">\n    <summary>Capacity and placement details</summary><div class=\"ui-more-body\"><section class=\"ui-section\">\n    <header><h4>After the move</h4></header>\n    <div class=\"deploy-capacity ui-stack\">\n    <div class=\"capacity-placement\"><section class=\"ui-section\">\n    <header><h4>Host</h4></header>\n    <b>Host not determined</b><p class=\"ui-help\">This review has not confirmed any suitable host.</p></section></div>\n    <section class=\"ui-section\">\n    <header><h4>Placement and memory</h4></header>\n    <div class=\"ui-callout warn\" role=\"alert\">\n      <span class=\"ui-callout-icon\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#i-alert\"/></svg></span>\n      <div><div class=\"ui-notice-line ui-notice-whole\"><b class=\"ui-notice-head\">Check the placement and memory.</b><span class=\"ui-notice-first ui-issue-short\">unknown &lt;memory&gt;</span></div></div>\n    </div></section>\n    <details class=\"ui-more\" data-disclosure=\"How this is estimated\">\n    <summary>How this is estimated</summary><div class=\"ui-more-body\">\n      \n      <p>Capacity warnings, such as high expected memory use or missing usage figures, can be accepted. Continuing may cause memory shortages, restarts or downtime. It does not change the reserved resources or limits.</p>\n      <p>This is a snapshot. It does not reserve capacity or guarantee that memory is sufficient. Homestead checks again before creating anything. The planned volumes have not been created yet.</p></div></details>\n    \n  </div></section><section class=\"ui-section\">\n    <header><h4>Temporary copy helper</h4></header>\n    <div class=\"deploy-capacity ui-stack\">\n    <div class=\"capacity-placement\"><section class=\"ui-section\">\n    <header><h4>Host</h4></header>\n    <b>Host not determined</b><p class=\"ui-help\">This review has not confirmed any suitable host.</p></section></div>\n    <section class=\"ui-section\">\n    <header><h4>Placement and memory</h4></header>\n    </section>\n    <details class=\"ui-more\" data-disclosure=\"How this is estimated\">\n    <summary>How this is estimated</summary><div class=\"ui-more-body\">\n      \n      <p>Capacity warnings, such as high expected memory use or missing usage figures, can be accepted. Continuing may cause memory shortages, restarts or downtime. It does not change the reserved resources or limits.</p>\n      <p>This is a snapshot. It does not reserve capacity or guarantee that memory is sufficient. Homestead checks again before creating anything. The planned volumes have not been created yet.</p></div></details>\n    \n  </div></section></div></details><label class=\"ui-ack\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"editCapacityConfirm\"><span>Move its storage despite the outage and the warnings</span></label><div class=\"ui-actions\" >\n      <div class=\"ui-actions-start\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn\" onclick=\"modalBack()\" data-dialog-dismiss=\"true\">Back to edit</button></div><div class=\"ui-actions-end\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn pri\" id=\"editGo\" onclick=\"confirmEdit()\" >Start data move</button></div></div>"
